  "result": "Excellent! All 74 tests pass. I've added:\n\n**src/numbering.js** \u2014 `nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)`:\n- Generates invoice numbers in format `INV-<year>-<counter>`\n- Counter is 4 digits, zero-padded (0001, 0002, ... 0099, 0100, etc.)\n- Extracts year from issueDate (YYYY-MM-DD) and filters existing numbers by year\n- Resets counter to 0001 for each new year\n- Handles numbers in any order and ignores malformed entries\n\n**issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)** in src/invoices.js:\n- Issues a draft invoice by assigning it a number and changing status to 'issued'\n- Returns fail('NOT_DRAFT') if the invoice isn't in draft status\n- Never mutates the original invoice\n- Calls `nextInvoiceNumber` to generate the next invoice number\n\n**test/numbering.test.js** \u2014 11 tests covering:\n- First invoice and subsequent invoices\n- Out-of-order and large counter values\n- Year boundaries and resets\n- Robustness against non-matching and malformed numbers\n- Format consistency\n\n**8 new tests for issueInvoice** covering:\n- Issuing invoices with empty, same-year, and cross-year existing numbers\n- Preserving all invoice data through the operation\n- Immutability of the original invoice\n- Error cases (NOT_DRAFT for issued/sent invoices)\n- Multiple invoices issued on the same day",
